 event name, such as ",[311,399,400],{},"order.paid",", ",[311,403,404],{},"refund.completed",", or ",[311,407,408],{},"subscription_plan.update_approved",". See the ",[316,411,318],{"href":412},"\u002Fguides\u002Fwebhooks#event-types"," for the full list.",[332,415,416,421,426],{},[350,417,418],{},[311,419,420],{},"reason",[350,422,423],{},[311,424,425],{},"string | null",[350,427,428,429,432,433,436,437,401,440,405,443,446],{},"Why the event fired, for events with more than one cause. Always present; ",[311,430,431],{},"null"," for every event except ",[311,434,435],{},"subscription.updated",", where it is ",[311,438,439],{},"updated_immediately",[311,441,442],{},"updated_on_renewal",[311,444,445],{},"renewed",". New values may be added over time.",[332,448,449,454,458],{},[350,450,451],{},[311,452,453],{},"entityType",[350,455,456],{},[311,457,359],{},[350,459,460,461,401,464,401,467,401,470,401,473,405,476,319],{},"The resource type the event refers to, such as ",[311,462,463],{},"order",[311,465,466],{},"refund",[311,468,469],{},"subscription",[311,471,472],{},"checkout",[311,474,475],{},"one_off_product",[311,477,478],{},"subscription_plan",[332,480,481,486,490],{},[350,482,483],{},[311,484,485],{},"entityId",[350,487,488],{},[311,489,359],{},[350,491,492],{},"The ID of the related resource.",[332,494,495,500,504],{},[350,496,497],{},[311,498,499],{},"object",[350,501,502],{},[311,503,499],{},[350,505,506,507,509,510,513,514,516,517,520,521,319],{},"The full resource payload as it existed when the event occurred (an Order, Chargeback, Refund, Subscription, Checkout, OneOffProduct, or SubscriptionPlan), keyed by its own ",[311,508,373],{}," field. Note ",[311,511,512],{},"object.resource"," can differ from ",[311,515,453],{},": chargeback events carry ",[311,518,519],{},"entityType: order"," but a Chargeback ",[311,522,499],{},[332,524,525,530,534],{},[350,526,527],{},[311,528,529],{},"createdAt",[350,531,532],{},[311,533,359],{},[350,535,536],{},"When the even